.TH "REPROCTL\-HELP\-JSON" "7" "2026" "reproctl" "Repro Development Tools"
.SH NAME
reproctl\-help\-json \- JSON output conventions for reproctl commands
.SH DESCRIPTION
Several reproctl commands support a \f[B]\-\-json\f[R] global flag that
switches output from human\-readable text to machine\-readable JSON.
This page documents the output conventions and schemas.
.SH CONVENTIONS
\f[B]List commands\f[R] return an object with an \f[B]items\f[R] array:
.IP
.EX
{ \(dqitems\(dq: [ ... ] }
.EE
.PP
\f[B]Single\-object commands\f[R] return a top\-level JSON object
directly.
.PP
\f[B]Streaming exception\f[R]: \f[B]reproctl logs \-\-json\f[R] outputs
newline\-delimited JSON (NDJSON) \(em one JSON object per line \(em
because log output is unbounded.
.SH SUPPORTED COMMANDS
.TP
\f[B]reproctl \-\-json doctor\f[R]
Returns an object with an \f[B]items\f[R] array.
Each item contains:
.RS
.IP
.EX
{
  \(dqitems\(dq: [
    {
      \(dqname\(dq: \(dqnode\(dq,
      \(dqstatus\(dq: \(dqok\(dq,
      \(dqexpected\(dq: \(dq26.4.0\(dq,
      \(dqactual\(dq: \(dq26.4.0\(dq
    }
  ]
}
.EE
.RE
.TP
\f[B]reproctl \-\-json checkhealth\f[R]
Returns an object with an \f[B]items\f[R] array.
Each item contains:
.RS
.IP
.EX
{
  \(dqitems\(dq: [
    {
      \(dqname\(dq: \(dqtilt\(dq,
      \(dqstatus\(dq: \(dqok\(dq,
      \(dqmessage\(dq: \(dqTilt is running\(dq
    }
  ]
}
.EE
.RE
.TP
\f[B]reproctl \-\-json status\f[R]
Returns an object describing Tilt state and running resources:
.RS
.IP
.EX
{
  \(dqtilt\(dq: { \(dqrunning\(dq: true, \(dqurl\(dq: \(dqhttp://localhost:10350\(dq },
  \(dqitems\(dq: [
    {
      \(dqname\(dq: \(dqapi\-server\(dq,
      \(dqstatus\(dq: \(dqok\(dq,
      \(dqtype\(dq: \(dqk8s\(dq
    }
  ]
}
.EE
.RE
.TP
\f[B]reproctl \-\-json context\f[R]
Returns a single object with context fields:
.RS
.IP
.EX
{
  \(dqworktree\(dq: \(dqfeat/REP\-123\-auth\(dq,
  \(dqbranch\(dq: \(dqfeat/REP\-123\-auth\(dq,
  \(dqpath\(dq: \(dq/path/to/worktree\(dq,
  \(dqissue\(dq: \(dqREP\-123\(dq,
  \(dqmain\(dq: false
}
.EE
.RE
.TP
\f[B]reproctl \-\-json wt list\f[R]
Returns an object with an \f[B]items\f[R] array of worktree objects:
.RS
.IP
.EX
{
  \(dqitems\(dq: [
    {
      \(dqbranch\(dq: \(dqfeat/REP\-123\-auth\(dq,
      \(dqpath\(dq: \(dq/path/to/worktree\(dq,
      \(dqhead\(dq: \(dqabc1234\(dq
    }
  ]
}
.EE
.RE
.TP
\f[B]reproctl logs \-\-json\f[R]
Outputs NDJSON (one object per line, not wrapped in an array):
.RS
.IP
.EX
{\(dqtimestamp\(dq:\(dq2026\-01\-15T10:30:00Z\(dq,\(dqservice\(dq:\(dqapi\-server\(dq,\(dqlevel\(dq:\(dqinfo\(dq,\(dqmessage\(dq:\(dqlistening on :3000\(dq}
{\(dqtimestamp\(dq:\(dq2026\-01\-15T10:30:01Z\(dq,\(dqservice\(dq:\(dqapi\-server\(dq,\(dqlevel\(dq:\(dqinfo\(dq,\(dqmessage\(dq:\(dqconnected to database\(dq}
.EE
.RE
